10.1.20.5 ‘org-clock’ _(built-in / Nix)_
........................................

Built-in time tracking with persistence across restarts.  Lets you
resume an interrupted clock without losing the entry.

10.1.20.6 ‘org-appear’
......................

Reveal Org emphasis markers (‘*’ ‘_’ ‘/’ ‘~’) only when point is on them
