10.1.20.7 ‘org-modern’
......................

Modern visual styling for Org buffers and agenda -- typographic bullets,
faux-rendered blocks, agenda decorations.

10.1.20.8 ‘org-roam’
....................

Zettelkasten-style note-linking on top of Org.  SQLite database
auto-syncs in the background; C-c n f / i / c are the three bindings you
actually use day-to-day.

