..........................................

Tree-sitter QML major mode (xhcoding/qml-ts-mode), for editing
Quickshell / Qt Quick ‘.qml' files. Provided by Nix; its ’qmljs' grammar
ships via treesit-grammars.with-all-grammars.  LSP through eglot → qmlls
and format-on-save through apheleia → qmlformat are both configured in
init-prog.  The Qt tooling (qmlls/qmlformat) rides the distribution
wrapper PATH (nix/runtime-deps.nix).


